# TypeScript vertical-slice toolchain. Each value is the executable path of
# the effect-tsgo realization pinned by this repository's flake inputs. The
# selected path is immutable and identical across worktrees on the same host
# platform, so it is both the command and the action-key identity (EXEC-R02).
